---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Completed and in-progress data science, machine learning, engineering and software projects by Nicholas Perikli."/><title>Case Studies — Nicholas Perikli</title></head><body>
<header><div class="container nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><div class="monogram"><span>N</span><span>P</span></div><span class="wordmark">Nicholas Perikli</span></a><nav><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/case-studies">Case Studies</a><a href="/about">About</a><a class="cta" href="mailto:nicholasperikli@gmail.com">Contact</a></nav></div></header>
<main>
<section class="page-head"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Selected work</div><h1>Case studies</h1><p class="section-lead">Seven completed projects with evidence-backed results, plus two clearly labelled projects in progress. Every completed case starts with the plain-English problem and business value before the technical detail.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Completed work</div><h2 class="section-title">Evidence-backed projects</h2><div class="cards">{completed.map(c=><article class="card"><span class="tag">{c.tag}</span><h3>{c.title}</h3><p>{c.body}</p><a href={c.href}>Read case study →</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Work in progress</div><h2 class="section-title">Current builds</h2><p class="section-lead">Included for transparency and breadth, but deliberately not presented as completed work.</p><div class="cards">{inProgress.map(c=><article class="card wip"><span class="status-pill">In progress</span><span class="tag">{c.tag}</span><h3>{c.title}</h3><p>{c.body}</p><a href={c.href}>View current project status →</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="container footer-grid"><a class="brand" href="/"><div class="monogram"><span>N</span><span>P</span></div><span class="wordmark">Nicholas Perikli</span></a><div class="small">7 completed · 2 in progress</div></div></footer></body></html>